# armour/shared/pauldron_feather4_l: the large FEATHER pauldron on the left shoulder (feather.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# a cape of feathers over both shoulders and the collar: rows of pointed feather tips, the people's colour
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the hem, P the clumps' lit faces, G the clasp.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron feather.4
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

